-33\" x=\"60\" y=\"-686\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"860\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(3305,0)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"620\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\" transform=\"translate(60,676)\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-35\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-38\" x=\"60\" y=\"-687\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"4166\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(6611,0)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"1121\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\" transform=\"translate(310,676)\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-37\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(60,-687)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-31\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>In this lesson, we will use models to divide whole numbers by unit fractions. </p>\n<p>Let's start with an example. Suppose we divide the pizza below into fifths. How many fifths will there be in total?</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div id=\"graphic-bdeb74695b5e81dbe0c88b3c38d38a41\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/bdeb74695b5e81dbe0c88b3c38d38a41\"></div> \n\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Since each part is <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.999ex\" height=\"5.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -1.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1437.2 860.5 2228.5\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-6-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-6-Title\">\\dfrac{1}{\\color{blue}5}</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E6-MJMAIN-31\" d=\"M213 578L200 573Q186 568 160 563T102 556H83V602H102Q149 604 189 617T245 641T273 663Q275 666 285 666Q294 666 302 660V361L303 61Q310 54 315 52T339 48T401 46H427V0H416Q395 3 257 3Q121 3 100 0H88V46H114Q136 46 152 46T177 47T193 50T201 52T207 57T213 61V578Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E6-MJMAIN-35\" d=\"M164 157Q164 133 148 117T109 101H102Q148 22 224 22Q294 22 326 82Q345 115 345 210Q345 313 318 349Q292 382 260 382H254Q176 382 136 314Q132 307 129 306T114 304Q97 304 95 310Q93 314 93 485V614Q93 664 98 664Q100 666 102 666Q103 666 123 658T178 642T253 634Q324 634 389 662Q397 666 402 666Q410 666 410 648V635Q328 538 205 538Q174 538 149 544L139 546V374Q158 388 169 396T205 412T256 420Q337 420 393 355T449 201Q449 109 385 44T229 -22Q148 -22 99 32T50 154Q50 178 61 192T84 210T107 214Q132 214 148 197T164 157Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"620\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"60\" y=\"676\"></use>\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\" transform=\"translate(60,-687)\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-35\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span> of a whole, we need to split <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.162ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 500.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-7-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-7-Title\">\\color{red}1</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E7-MJMAIN-31\" d=\"M213 578L200 573Q186 568 160 563T102 556H83V602H102Q149 604 189 617T245 641T273 663Q275 666 285 666Q294 666 302 660V361L303 61Q310 54 315 52T339 48T401 46H427V0H416Q395 3 257 3Q121 3 100 0H88V46H114Q136 46 152 46T177 47T193 50T201 52T207 57T213 61V578Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-31\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span> pizza (whole) into <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.162ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 500.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-8-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-8-Title\">\\color{blue}5</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E8-MJMAIN-35\" d=\"M164 157Q164 133 148 117T109 101H102Q148 22 224 22Q294 22 326 82Q345 115 345 210Q345 313 318 349Q292 382 260 382H254Q176 382 136 314Q132 307 129 306T114 304Q97 304 95 310Q93 314 93 485V614Q93 664 98 664Q100 666 102 666Q103 666 123 658T178 642T253 634Q324 634 389 662Q397 666 402 666Q410 666 410 648V635Q328 538 205 538Q174 538 149 544L139 546V374Q158 388 169 396T205 412T256 420Q337 420 393 355T449 201Q449 109 385 44T229 -22Q148 -22 99 32T50 154Q50 178 61 192T84 210T107 214Q132 214 148 197T164 157Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-35\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span> equal parts, as shown below.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div id=\"graphic-828ebcf60f24141fa5b9424a664299b8\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/828ebcf60f24141fa5b9424a664299b8\"></div> \n\n<p><br></p>\n<p>So, we get <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"9.426ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 4058.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-9-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-9-Title\">{\\color{red}1} \\times {\\color{blue}5} = 5</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E9-MJMAIN-31\" d=\"M213 578L200 573Q186 568 160 563T102 556H83V602H102Q149 604 189 617T245 641T273 663Q275 666 285 666Q294 666 302 660V361L303 61Q310 54 315 52T339 48T401 46H427V0H416Q395 3 257 3Q121 3 100 0H88V46H114Q136 46 152 46T177 47T193 50T201 52T207 57T213 61V578Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E9-MJMAIN-D7\" d=\"M630 29Q630 9 609 9Q604 9 587 25T493 118L389 222L284 117Q178 13 175 11Q171 9 168 9Q160 9 154 15T147 29Q147 36 161 51T255 146L359 250L255 354Q174 435 161 449T147 471Q147 480 153 485T168 490Q173 490 175 489Q178 487 284 383L389 278L493 382Q570 459 587 475T609 491Q630 491 630 471Q630 464 620 453T522 355L418 250L522 145Q606 61 618 48T630 29Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E9-MJMAIN-35\" d=\"M164 157Q164 133 148 117T109 101H102Q148 22 224 22Q294 22 326 82Q345 115 345 210Q345 313 318 349Q292 382 260 382H254Q176 382 136 314Q132 307 129 306T114 304Q97 304 95 310Q93 314 93 485V614Q93 664 98 664Q100 666 102 666Q103 666 123 658T178 642T253 634Q324 634 389 662Q397 666 402 666Q410 666 410 648V635Q328 538 205 538Q174 538 149 544L139 546V374Q158 388 169 396T205 412T256 420Q337 420 393 355T449 201Q449 109 385 44T229 -22Q148 -22 99 32T50 154Q50 178 61 192T84 210T107 214Q132 214 148 197T164 157Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E9-MJMAIN-3D\" d=\"M56 347Q56 360 70 367H707Q722 359 722 347Q722 336 708 328L390 327H72Q56 332 56 347ZM56 153Q56 168 72 173H708Q722 163 722 153Q722 140 707 133H70Q56 140 56 153Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E9-MJMAIN-31\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E9-MJMAIN-D7\" x=\"722\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(1723,0)\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E9-MJMAIN-35\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E9-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"2501\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E9-MJMAIN-35\" x=\"3558\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> parts in total.</p>\n\n        </div>",
